# ── Lead delivery ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leads from the form are sent to BOTH Telegram and email.
# Configure either or both. If none are set, leads are logged to the
# server console (so the form still works) — set these in production.

# Telegram bot ─ create a bot via @BotFather, then get the chat/group id
# (e.g. message the bot and read https://api.telegram.org/bot<token>/getUpdates)
# The SAME bot also delivers per-employee task/lead assignment alerts: set each
# staff member's personal chat id in their CRM profile (Staff → edit → Telegram
# Chat ID). If a staffer has no personal id, their alert falls back to the
# global TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID below (the company channel).
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=

# Email via Resend (https://resend.com) ─ verify your domain first
RESEND_API_KEY=
LEAD_EMAIL_FROM="BIZBUYUK <leads@bizbuyuk.com>"
LEAD_EMAIL_TO=info@bizbuyuk.com
